[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] --- prompt.md ---
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] # Documentation Website for exemplar.tools CLI Suite
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] ## System Context
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] This is a single-page React application that serves as a developer reference for the exemplar.tools CLI suite. The website provides documentation for running commands across 14 different tools, sourced entirely from a single howto.md file. Developers use this site to look up command syntax, copy-paste CLI commands, and access embedded YouTube tutorials. The application is built with TypeScript, Vite, React, and Tailwind CSS, deployed to Vercel as a static site.
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] ## Consequence Map
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] **High Severity:**
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Incorrect CLI commands copied by developers → broken builds, corrupted data, security vulnerabilities
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Missing or broken YouTube video embeds → developers stuck without visual guidance
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Navigation failures → developers unable to find tool documentation
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] **Medium Severity:**
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Styling/layout issues → poor developer experience, reduced adoption
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Slow load times → developer productivity impact
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Deployment failures → documentation unavailable
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] **Low Severity:**
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Version badge display issues → confusion about tool versions
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Minor formatting inconsistencies → aesthetic concerns
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] ## Failure Archaeology
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] No specific failure history provided. This appears to be a new system build. Key risks identified:
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Static content extraction from markdown requires careful parsing
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - YouTube embed integration needs proper iframe handling
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Copy-paste accuracy is critical for CLI commands
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Vercel deployment requires proper build output configuration
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
