[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Vercel deployment platform
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] **Downstream Impact:**
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Developer productivity using exemplar.tools
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] - Accuracy of CLI command execution in production systems
[2026-05-19T18:25:17Z] 
